(7760113, 1285143, 50864, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. I love the distorted face. I like Francis Bacon paintings and this is as interesting with the third eye and distorted mouth. The cape looks like a painting and the white specs on top are perfect. Easy 10 for me.</td>', 'This is amazing. I love the distorted face. I like Francis Bacon paintings and this is as interesting with the third eye and distorted mouth. The cape looks like a painting and the white specs on top are perfect. Easy 10 for me.', '2023-11-17 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
